# Persistence

- One DB; schemas: identity, knowledge, research, content, catalog, publication, commerce, learning, wolverine.
- Aggregate-specific repositories only — no `IRepository<T>`.
- No custom UoW; EF + Wolverine middleware commits.
- timestamptz UTC; UUIDv7 preferred; bigint concurrency → ETag.
- Soft delete not default — lifecycle states/tombstones when required.
- `IBlobStore`: Put/OpenRead/Exists by content hash; atomic rename to SHA-256 path.
- Unique: canonical source URI, content hash, association pairs, provider+external_id.
- Status + updated_at indexes for queues; check constraints for legal states/confidence.
- Raw SQL only for measured hot paths/migrations in Infrastructure + tests.
- Migrations: forward verify + rollback/roll-forward notes; advisory lock; separate job.
